# Build context exclusions.
#
# The build COPYs exactly these paths from the context:
#   keys/samba-release-key.asc   (GPG verification of the Samba tarball)
#   runtime-packages.txt         (the runtime package manifest)
#   entrypoint/                  (the Go entrypoint, built in-image)
#   chrony/chrony.conf           (the baked MS-SNTP configuration)
# Everything excluded below is either irrelevant to the build or pure
# documentation churn that would otherwise invalidate the context on
# every prose commit. Deliberately conservative: files a later phase may
# need in the context (versions.yaml, scripts/) are left in.

# Source control and CI metadata
.git
.gitattributes
.github

# Planning/controller scratch, never part of a build
.superpowers

# Documentation: SPEC.md, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, SECURITY.md,
# docs/**, keys/PINNING.md — none of it is COPYed.
docs
**/*.md

# Local scratch and editor droppings
*.log
.DS_Store
docker-compose.override.yml
